<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=213" title="View the profile of Kinson">Kinson</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 110<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.disorder.com/eq/kinsonn-avatar.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								buh<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=213"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=518.msg3860#msg3860"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=518.msg3860#msg3860">Thumppy</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> December 16, 2003, 09:45:37 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Don&#039;t know who would be stupid enough to fall for this..but..anyway<br /><br />I&#039;m in the bazaar, and some random level 40 mage(Thumppy) in the zone sends me a tell asking how much plat I have. I told him 123pp(sadly the truth) so he asks if I have any old warrior gear(he&#039;s not a warrior)..told him its all no drop. Then he asks if I remember [insert random unheard of name] and says we used to be best friends...few minutes later he says he used to have my account info but forgot it, and remembers playing me in Dreadlands. Riiight..very few people have my account info, and the only ones that do are a few from my last guild that disbanded(which mostly moved to my current guild) and a very few more people from my current guild. So he keeps bugging me about my account info for a few minutes while I&#039;m not replying, so I report him and then tell him to get a pencil..He then says &quot;are u lieing&quot; and i say &quot;me?? of course not. we&#039;re best friends remember?&quot; So..i tell him account name: waxbutt04, password:slipsingood. He asks when I&#039;m logging off, I don&#039;t answer, he disappears and comes back a few minutes later bitching bout the info doesn&#039;t work. Soo..extremely stupid and bad attempt at scamming someone out of their account info..wouldn&#039;t get involved in any types of dealings with him if I were the rest of you.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: December 16, 2003, 09:46:31 pm by Kinson</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
